{"2453640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Stone Unturned", "steam_appid": 2453640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/7ca7f7c15b45b136aba905619ffd5df2.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/7ca7f7c15b45b136aba905619ffd5df2.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/82984ce7941c04aaf16c51e465646fdb.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/82984ce7941c04aaf16c51e465646fdb.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d5a279940927403346495a78a5df7a0e.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d5a279940927403346495a78a5df7a0e.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2062e17f6462dace8e2814eb2f815477.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2062e17f6462dace8e2814eb2f815477.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2062e17f6462dace8e2814eb2f815477.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 10+ Hrs of   Story Content!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Detective Cox piece together the mystery of Orchard Under Hill while experiencing a fully voice-acted cast of wacky characters with absurd British humour from start to finish. Underneath this, a genuinely rich murder mystery experience (following the teachings of Edgar Allen Poe, Agatha Christie and Sir Arthur Conan Doyle). <br>Can you figure out 'who-dunnit' yourself before Detective Cox / by the end of the game? Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/ef5d1aba8f81ff5c4b1c767ba0afe3d6.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/ef5d1aba8f81ff5c4b1c767ba0afe3d6.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4f37b02571895dad798410c90b000535.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4f37b02571895dad798410c90b000535.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4f37b02571895dad798410c90b000535.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solve the Grand Mystery of 'A Murder Most Fowl' by solving 3  Classic Cases!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn why The Hare and the Tortoise are at each other's throats, what's got the Cat's tongue, and Who Really Killed the Chicken! Following absurd storylines based on fairy tales, jokes or children's stories with a delightfully dark twist that feels like a blend of Saturday morning cartoons and classic British sit-coms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d1053e053e01a5e7f3da50e04b5fc452.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d1053e053e01a5e7f3da50e04b5fc452.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience 20+ Mini-Game Types!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ranging from stealth, turn-based, rhythm, puzzle, boxing and many more crazy mini-games block your path to victory! With references to all your favourite games, cinema &amp; pop culture littered throughout the world of No Stone Unturned! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a0729051984274302b9608384adb03b0.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a0729051984274302b9608384adb03b0.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a0729051984274302b9608384adb03b0.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/e1bd3810a2eab655b5fe49296971bc37.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/e1bd3810a2eab655b5fe49296971bc37.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/6655115cf1234132175f0eb5a3c85692.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/6655115cf1234132175f0eb5a3c85692.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/6655115cf1234132175f0eb5a3c85692.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/3b64933a4953c1058d2385cb4097fb2d.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/3b64933a4953c1058d2385cb4097fb2d.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2a6623eb8b44ba8d68cf128fbb14e747.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2a6623eb8b44ba8d68cf128fbb14e747.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2a6623eb8b44ba8d68cf128fbb14e747.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/944949596d326ebf0668e4a1c5061997.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/944949596d326ebf0668e4a1c5061997.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a100952e941880be32e17b1c4c6850eb.avif?t=1780694936\" width=720 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Cam the Beaver Repair the Town of Orchard-Under-Hill! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Broaden your horizons (and the literal map) by repairing bridges, buildings and other broken... things... for this  village on the brink of ruin, completing item bundles to unlock new areas and uncover essential clues. I’m sure the answer to all of your problems lies just behind that fallen log… It must be so DAM good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/f2a6f2d4fff8b5ee3fd587804218fcd3.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/f2a6f2d4fff8b5ee3fd587804218fcd3.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/8b554ae05192277fe2dfa89330c86f8b.avif?t=1780694936\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Detective Cox prove his theories by assembling a mob and bringing the killer to justice, just make sure you've got all the evidence you need first... It would be pretty embarrassing to gather the WHOLE village for a big reveal just for the whole thing to be a wild goose chase... right? (Could a wild goose have done it?...) Use clues you collect from crime scenes to prove characters wrong in  climactic accusations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/ec1459b12db7bc83245589398013c62c.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/ec1459b12db7bc83245589398013c62c.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/61fd2c177add77c04fca2d2f6304bd1f.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/61fd2c177add77c04fca2d2f6304bd1f.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/61fd2c177add77c04fca2d2f6304bd1f.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We put real effort into hiding as many stones as possible in the world so we can truly live up to the name, can you find  all of the hidden stones and in-game achievements...? Good luck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/9a99e62d68da429c0bbe42561a7ff687.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/9a99e62d68da429c0bbe42561a7ff687.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/c29d4f7d821aae1372a3fad96850919f.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/c29d4f7d821aae1372a3fad96850919f.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Our Musical Numbers Are Sung By Characters In-World! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We put maximum effort into EVERY aspect of No Stone Unturned, which includes a 100% original soundtrack featuring talented singers and excellent compositions by composers Charlie Persson and Logan Hart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d154886e544bb7f8e7ab5807ff58edb5.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d154886e544bb7f8e7ab5807ff58edb5.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/42092e8674241731e12923d7c3ec0f70.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crack the Case Wide Open Like an Egg! A CHICKEN EGG?! It's all adding up...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Detective Cox is set on becoming the Greatest Detective in the World! Help him search for clues, solve puzzles, and learn about this story-rich world of troubled animals as they all try to survive in a civilisation  on the brink of crisis. Speaking of  troubled animals...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/8931074e4314ffc1921b7839a6ae8933.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4c4900ab3a5df55927fae9c6af02a27c.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/4c4900ab3a5df55927fae9c6af02a27c.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something Sinister This Way Comes...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Armed with your trusty Detective Essentials (a magnifying glass, tape recorder and crowbar - just in case),  solve puzzles, analyse crime scenes, interrogate townsfolk and unturn stones to solve six gruesome crimes. Come to think of it, that’s a worrying number of crimes for one small village… Are you sure you’re up to the task?... Something big is happening in this little village... Can you save the entire world before it's too late? The Giant Wise Monkey in your dreams certainly seems to think so!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d14e98e226671fe900e20e166a3afb82.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d14e98e226671fe900e20e166a3afb82.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a00ed52a0a3e712fc260b1ddeef2dbca.avif?t=1780694936\" width=1382 height=628 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Want to Support the Game? You Can  Play the First Case &amp; Leave a Review! (It helps us more than you know!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don’t let this 100% human-made case go cold! Join us on our Discord server to get more behind-the-scenes info!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/9f0251277214d61a02e3e491a8662097.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/7ca7f7c15b45b136aba905619ffd5df2.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/7ca7f7c15b45b136aba905619ffd5df2.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/82984ce7941c04aaf16c51e465646fdb.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/82984ce7941c04aaf16c51e465646fdb.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d5a279940927403346495a78a5df7a0e.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d5a279940927403346495a78a5df7a0e.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2062e17f6462dace8e2814eb2f815477.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2062e17f6462dace8e2814eb2f815477.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2062e17f6462dace8e2814eb2f815477.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 10+ Hrs of   Story Content!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Detective Cox piece together the mystery of Orchard Under Hill while experiencing a fully voice-acted cast of wacky characters with absurd British humour from start to finish. Underneath this, a genuinely rich murder mystery experience (following the teachings of Edgar Allen Poe, Agatha Christie and Sir Arthur Conan Doyle). <br>Can you figure out 'who-dunnit' yourself before Detective Cox / by the end of the game? Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/ef5d1aba8f81ff5c4b1c767ba0afe3d6.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/ef5d1aba8f81ff5c4b1c767ba0afe3d6.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4f37b02571895dad798410c90b000535.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4f37b02571895dad798410c90b000535.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4f37b02571895dad798410c90b000535.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solve the Grand Mystery of 'A Murder Most Fowl' by solving 3  Classic Cases!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn why The Hare and the Tortoise are at each other's throats, what's got the Cat's tongue, and Who Really Killed the Chicken! Following absurd storylines based on fairy tales, jokes or children's stories with a delightfully dark twist that feels like a blend of Saturday morning cartoons and classic British sit-coms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d1053e053e01a5e7f3da50e04b5fc452.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d1053e053e01a5e7f3da50e04b5fc452.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience 20+ Mini-Game Types!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ranging from stealth, turn-based, rhythm, puzzle, boxing and many more crazy mini-games block your path to victory! With references to all your favourite games, cinema &amp; pop culture littered throughout the world of No Stone Unturned! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a0729051984274302b9608384adb03b0.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a0729051984274302b9608384adb03b0.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a0729051984274302b9608384adb03b0.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/e1bd3810a2eab655b5fe49296971bc37.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/e1bd3810a2eab655b5fe49296971bc37.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/6655115cf1234132175f0eb5a3c85692.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/6655115cf1234132175f0eb5a3c85692.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/6655115cf1234132175f0eb5a3c85692.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/3b64933a4953c1058d2385cb4097fb2d.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/3b64933a4953c1058d2385cb4097fb2d.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2a6623eb8b44ba8d68cf128fbb14e747.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2a6623eb8b44ba8d68cf128fbb14e747.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/2a6623eb8b44ba8d68cf128fbb14e747.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/944949596d326ebf0668e4a1c5061997.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/944949596d326ebf0668e4a1c5061997.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a100952e941880be32e17b1c4c6850eb.avif?t=1780694936\" width=720 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Cam the Beaver Repair the Town of Orchard-Under-Hill! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Broaden your horizons (and the literal map) by repairing bridges, buildings and other broken... things... for this  village on the brink of ruin, completing item bundles to unlock new areas and uncover essential clues. I’m sure the answer to all of your problems lies just behind that fallen log… It must be so DAM good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/f2a6f2d4fff8b5ee3fd587804218fcd3.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/f2a6f2d4fff8b5ee3fd587804218fcd3.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/8b554ae05192277fe2dfa89330c86f8b.avif?t=1780694936\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Detective Cox prove his theories by assembling a mob and bringing the killer to justice, just make sure you've got all the evidence you need first... It would be pretty embarrassing to gather the WHOLE village for a big reveal just for the whole thing to be a wild goose chase... right? (Could a wild goose have done it?...) Use clues you collect from crime scenes to prove characters wrong in  climactic accusations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/ec1459b12db7bc83245589398013c62c.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/ec1459b12db7bc83245589398013c62c.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/61fd2c177add77c04fca2d2f6304bd1f.poster.avif?t=1780694936\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/61fd2c177add77c04fca2d2f6304bd1f.webm?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/61fd2c177add77c04fca2d2f6304bd1f.mp4?t=1780694936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We put real effort into hiding as many stones as possible in the world so we can truly live up to the name, can you find  all of the hidden stones and in-game achievements...? Good luck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/9a99e62d68da429c0bbe42561a7ff687.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/9a99e62d68da429c0bbe42561a7ff687.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/c29d4f7d821aae1372a3fad96850919f.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/c29d4f7d821aae1372a3fad96850919f.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Our Musical Numbers Are Sung By Characters In-World! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We put maximum effort into EVERY aspect of No Stone Unturned, which includes a 100% original soundtrack featuring talented singers and excellent compositions by composers Charlie Persson and Logan Hart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d154886e544bb7f8e7ab5807ff58edb5.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d154886e544bb7f8e7ab5807ff58edb5.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/42092e8674241731e12923d7c3ec0f70.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crack the Case Wide Open Like an Egg! A CHICKEN EGG?! It's all adding up...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Detective Cox is set on becoming the Greatest Detective in the World! Help him search for clues, solve puzzles, and learn about this story-rich world of troubled animals as they all try to survive in a civilisation  on the brink of crisis. Speaking of  troubled animals...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/8931074e4314ffc1921b7839a6ae8933.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/4c4900ab3a5df55927fae9c6af02a27c.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/4c4900ab3a5df55927fae9c6af02a27c.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something Sinister This Way Comes...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Armed with your trusty Detective Essentials (a magnifying glass, tape recorder and crowbar - just in case),  solve puzzles, analyse crime scenes, interrogate townsfolk and unturn stones to solve six gruesome crimes. Come to think of it, that’s a worrying number of crimes for one small village… Are you sure you’re up to the task?... Something big is happening in this little village... Can you save the entire world before it's too late? The Giant Wise Monkey in your dreams certainly seems to think so!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/d14e98e226671fe900e20e166a3afb82.avif?t=1780694936\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras_big/d14e98e226671fe900e20e166a3afb82.webp?t=1780694936 width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/a00ed52a0a3e712fc260b1ddeef2dbca.avif?t=1780694936\" width=1382 height=628 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Want to Support the Game? You Can  Play the First Case &amp; Leave a Review! (It helps us more than you know!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don’t let this 100% human-made case go cold! Join us on our Discord server to get more behind-the-scenes info!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/9f0251277214d61a02e3e491a8662097.avif?t=1780694936\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Why DID The Chicken Cross The Road? Time to solve a murder most... fowl. Join Detective Cox, the amnesiac squirrel, on an adventure through 10+ hrs of story, 20+ mini-games, references, a fully-voice-acted cast, and endless British humour. Be careful. You won't want to leave... No Stone Unturned.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I’d be shocked if No Stone Unturned doesn’t end up on our best games of the year list.”<br>Jump Dash Roll<br><br>“Everything a comedy indie game should be!”<br>5/5 – Gaming Furever<br><br>“No Stone Unturned is like if the word cheeky was a video game.”<br>Hey Poor Player<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/d671226a38452e8f87dccf0812dd75858973031b/header.jpg?t=1780694936", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/fa2a769be47e400023ae7c8aabc8c12c5e99e5b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780694936", 